= The Result

[? if vkpd_formed = 1 : The [+ e21_party +] wins 7.4 per cent of the vote and [+ e21_prussia_seats +] seats in the Landtag, more than the rump USPD. In the Merseburg constituency we are the largest party. The SPD remains the strongest party in Prussia, and the coalition will be formed without us, as always. ?][? if vkpd_formed != 1 : The KPD wins [+ e21_prussia_seats +] seats. The Independents, who kept their left wing, do better than we do in every industrial district. ?]

Ernst Reuter, who signs his articles as Friesland, writes that the result proves the party can become the party of the majority. Ruth Fischer writes that it proves nothing at all.
